description "Sith Seeker

Multi-life Dark Jedi pawns who seek out force users and attempt to ambush unsuspecting opponents with their cloak and inferior saber and force abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Life Steals/Force Focuses
- Sith Force Pike
-- Staff Pike (Staff/Cyan)
-- Single Pike (Blue/Yellow)
-- Dual Pikes (Dual/Purple)
-- Life Steals/Force Focuses
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- 50%+ Saber Spec Dmg mult
-- Much less Damage on hit

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Sense (1) 
- Drain (2)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (1)
- Reinforcements (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Tracking Beacon

^8Abilities:
- Force Dampeners (Tracking Darts 6) ^3[CS1]
-- Causes Force Focus/Cripple On Hit
-- Life Steals
- Cloaking Device (2) ^3[CS2]
- Binoculars ^3[CS4]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]"
